<title>USA: Port of Portland, Ore., repriced, top yld 5.93 pct.</title>
<headline>Port of Portland, Ore., repriced, top yld 5.93 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Wednesday it repriced $142.3 million Port of Portland, Ore., airport bonds, lowering yields in several maturities and cutting the top yield in 2026 to 5.93 percent from 5.97 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>THE PORT OF PORTLAND, OREGON</p>
<p>RE: $142,335,000*</p>
<p>PORTLAND INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS, SERIES ELEVEN</p>
